    <title>
      <narrative xml:lang="en">Preservation of the 12th-Century Royal Tombs of Tonga</narrative>
    </title>
    <description type="1">
      <narrative xml:lang="en">To support the preservation of the 12th-century royal tombs of Tonga in Lapaha. The tombs are the most significant monuments in the Kingdom of Tonga and an important ritual site for more than 500 years. This project involves the stabilization of each tomb and the development of a sustainable management plan for the site.</narrative>
    </description>
